inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\">\\(x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t,t^{\\prime}\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\">\\(t,t^{\\prime}\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\)</span>；见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c136ba3960a7223a\" href=\"?note=c136ba3960a7223a\" title=\"57-df-structure\">57-df-structure</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d5f7158a321b8947\" href=\"?note=d5f7158a321b8947\" title=\"57-df-assignment\">57-df-assignment</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"a088bed2d10e61da\" href=\"?note=a088bed2d10e61da\" title=\"57-df-substitution-term\">57-df-substitution-term</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"701e19aa09901897\" href=\"?note=701e19aa09901897\" title=\"57-df-term-interpretation\">57-df-term-interpretation</a>。为保留原接口，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak I(u)\">\\(\\mathfrak I(u)\\)</span> 缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u^{\\mathfrak A}[\\beta]\">\\(u^{\\mathfrak A}[\\beta]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak I_x^a(u)\">\\(\\mathfrak I_x^a(u)\\)</span> 缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u^{\\mathfrak A}[\\beta[a/x]]\">\\(u^{\\mathfrak A}[\\beta[a/x]]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in|\\mathfrak A|\">\\(a\\in|\\mathfrak A|\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak I(u)\\coloneqq u^{\\mathfrak A}[\\beta],\\qquad\n\\mathfrak I_x^a(u)\\coloneqq u^{\\mathfrak A}[\\beta[a/x]].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathfrak I(u)\\coloneqq u^{\\mathfrak A}[\\beta],\\qquad\n\\mathfrak I_x^a(u)\\coloneqq u^{\\mathfrak A}[\\beta[a/x]].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak I(t[t&#39;/x])=\\mathfrak I_x^{\\mathfrak I(t&#39;)}(t).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\